            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murder Miners X is the sequel to the #1 rated Xbox Live Indie Game: Murder Miners</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic sci-fi console shooters, with block-based levels and the best movement mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>This game is still in development, everything is subject to change.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALL of the features of the original Murder Miners (except for the ones that suck)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REAL fancy graphics powered by Unreal Engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BIGGER maps with hybrid smooth terrain and block system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOTS of new weapons, vehicles, and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TONS of new zombie abilities, and a more interesting zombie leveling system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BETTER map making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE smoothest movement mechanics (parkour)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MORE enemy types for Zombie AI, and better AI all around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EVEN MORE multiplayer game modes, and much better game customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEW Missions mode: Use the Map Maker to design missions using AI spawners and basic logic control. Compete solo or coop for the best mission score on the leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUGE Adventure Mode: Explore a randomly generated world full of powerful artifacts, dangerous enemies, and dark secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOOBA</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Believe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the Discussions and let us know what you are excited about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist and Follow this page to get updates, and find us on YouTube and X(Twitter)!</p></li></ul>",
